<b>Service Description: </b> Coast Survey themed service for public consumption featuring layers associated with navigation and marine transportation. This map service presents spatial information about encdirect.noaa.gov services across the United States and Territories in the Web Mercator projection. Coast Survey updates the information “weekly” and shall incur no responsibility or liability as to the completeness or accuracy of this information. NOAA assumes no responsibility arising from the use of this information. The NOAA Office for Coast Survey will make every effort to provide continual access to this service but it may need to be taken down during routine IT maintenance or in case of an emergency. For additional information, please contact the NOAA Office Coast Survey (ocs.gis@noaa.gov). <br/><br/>
